      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can certainly help with the test cases to ensure comprehensive coverage for your CyberShield firewall module. Here is the list:\n\n\n**Module: CyberShield Firewall Module Test Cases**\n\n\n1. Check dynamic IP blacklist API update functionality:\n\n   - Test Case 1: Verify that adding an IP to the blacklist works correctly.\n\n   - Test Case 2: Test the API for appending multiple IPs to the blacklist.\n\n   - Test Case 3: Confirm that updating IP blacklist via the API clears old rules.\n\n\n2. Protocol inspection verification:\n\n   - Test Case 4: Test for common header malformation in incoming TCP traffic.\n\n   - Test Case 5: Inspect UDP traffic for header malformations and ensure they are filtered out.\n\n   - Test Case 6: Test the firewall's reaction to malformed and non-malformed packets with identical payloads.\n\n\n3. Auto-scaling CPU load adjustments:\n\n   - Test Case 7: Simulate a high CPU load and verify that scaling rules are adjusted in real-time.\n\n   - Test Case 8: Validate the regeneration of scaling rules when CPU load returns to normal.\n\n   - Test Case 9: Check that improper rule regeneration doesn't occur under erroneous conditions.\n\n\n4. Log integrity validation:\n\n   -",
